# The verdict the migration scan must give each disk of this variant (doc 05 §3). The
# builder measures every row on the disks and refuses to build a variant whose
# rows the disks do not show; expected/scan.txt is this file with those facts.
# The boot + data device is classed as Unraid's boot device: partitions 1 to 3
# are left alone and partition 4, the cache pool, is re-created like every cache.
# The array proceeds, and the Flash Backup zip is the only configuration source.
disk parity parity
disk disk1 adopt
disk disk2 adopt
disk disk3 adopt
disk cache boot-device cache-recreated
config-source zip
